<title>FRANCE: Iran seeks 100,000 tonnes optional feed barley.</title>
<headline>Iran seeks 100,000 tonnes optional feed barley.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran will tender on June 9 to import 100,000 tonnes of optional feed barley for September shipment, European grain traders said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>On May 20 Iran bought 100,000 tonnes of optional-origin feed barley for shipment during August.</p>
<p>The pricing of the deal was not disclosed, but one European trader said the sale was equivalent to an fob export price of around $150 per tonne.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
